Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 10:27:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Distinguish live provider retries from backend crash
 recovery

Pass invocation-local refusal evidence from the retry timer, retain the machine-note prefix and leave cold crash replay unchanged. No durable marker or attempt policy changes.

Proof: new regression red on base (retry falsely claims backend stopped; crash control passes); 96 focused retry, crash and outcome tests pass.
